==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
A good strategy for this stage is to send out a fast attacker that's good against alien (e.g. [[Miter Saw Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Miter Saw Cat]]) to deal some damage to the Helmut Krabbes at the start of the level. After that, sending out a [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rusher cat]] (e.g. [[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Sanada Yukimura]]) to periodically deal large amounts of damage to whatever is in front of it. As long as you have some of these, you should be able to clear the stage in no time.

==='''Chapter 2'''===
For chapter 2, use a similar strategy as Chapter 1, but use more Anti Alien cats such as [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Surfer Cat]] to help with the Seals, This stage can easily be completed by spamming anti alien units.

